# Browser
# CR 106.6, 601.2h: two restricted kinds of {R} float, and either may pay Ragavan's {R}. Which pays is the player's to choose,
# whichever was made first. The Halfling's is made first and Rockface Village's is spent, by a click on its chip: the Halfling's
# stays floating, and nothing stops Counterspell countering the spell.

